orking on another sequel  according to the director himself he saw  it as an opportunity to start with a  blank canvas rather than building on the  previous films he told entertainment  weekly in 2019 it's hard to do plot  twists with characters that are known so  i wanted to do an origin movie that had  hardly anything to do with the original  kingsman he also says that you can watch  and enjoy the king's man even if you  haven't seen the other kingsman films  yet  since the king's band takes place so  many years before the events of the  secret service in the golden circle  taryn edgerton and colin firth will not  be returning to their starring roles as  eggsy and harry although a kingsman film  without edgerton and firth will  definitely have a different tone this  gives vaughn the chance to bring some  fresh faces into the fold and go in a  new direction with this film plus both  actors have been quite busy lately  edgerton starred as elton john in the  musical biopic rocket man which earned  overwhelmingly positive reviews from  critics and even generated some oscar  buzz more recently he voiced rihann and  the netflix jim henson puppet series the  dark crystal age of resistance and his  voice will be heard again in sing too in  which he'll return as johnny the gorilla  as for firth his recent roles include  the war drama 1917 as well as the secret  garden and supernova clearly not adverse  to acting through big scale conflict  he's also set to appear in another war  drama operation mincemeat  the king's man is a period film that  offers an alternative take on the events  of world war one leading up to the  establishment of the kingsman  organization proper it largely centers  on two characters harris dickinson's  conrad and his father ray finds his  orlando the duke of oxford we definitely  know that it's a period film set during  world war one but judging by the  irreverent tone of the previous kingsman  films it's not going to be a  run-of-the-mill historical drama  this gentleman's [ __ ] i'm gonna love  calling you harris dickinson is starring  in the king's man as conrad whose  aspirations to become a soldier and  fights in the global conflict end up  leading him in a very different  direction than he or his father  originally intended dickinson has raved  about his experience shooting the king's  man the actor said that he felt like he  had lots of creative freedom in his role  with the movie telling a new story that  doesn't rely on the previous films to  make sense in an interview with collider  dickinson said it's not like the  pressure of a sequel necessarily where  you've got to come in and continue the  story ray finds will play conrad's  father the duke of oxford and the  founder of the kingsman organization he  acts as a mentor to conrad throughout  the film teaching his son that while the  government might not take action to stop  injustice in time kingsmen can his  opinion is that espionage is a more  effective way of fighting than using  brute force not that his son necessarily  believes it  real power  is not found running off to war  fines told comicbook.com his son's  growing up and is full of a sense of  duty and wanting to prove himself as a  soldier and as a man of honor i try to  give him another perspective how you can  do more damage to the enemy by the right  intelligence and undercover work than  all-out war  the cast of the king's man is rounded  out by several accomplished actors gemma  arterton who recently lent her voice to  the tv adaptation of the novel watership  down will have a leading role as polly a  classy sharpshooter connected to the  proto-kingsman group jimin honsu known  as korath and marvel films like captain  marvel and guardians of the galaxy is  also involved in the adventure playing a  swashbuckling character by the name of  shola aaron taylor johnson is set to  play lee unwin a soldier who considering  the surname is likely one of eggsy  unwin's ancestors the movie's marketing  also predominantly features rhys ephons  known for his work as dr kirk connors  aka the lizard in the amazing spider-man  as well as an appearance in harry potter  and the deathly hallows part 1 as  xenophilius lovegood in the king's men  ethons will appear as a notorious  russian rasputin getting up to more  close quarters combat than you ever  would have expected while the kingsman  was still in production it was reported  that liam neeson would be appearing in  the film nissan did seem like a great  fit for a kingsman film but this casting  news was only a rumor bond told the  playlist back in 2019 i just rap the  movie and unless he's got some amazing  prosthetics and he's playing some  character i didn't know about he ain't  in the film never had a discussion i  love liam neeson and i'd love for him to  be in it but no i have no idea where  that came from  the king's man may be a prequel but that  doesn't mean we'll never find out what  happened to our modern day heroes after  the events of the golden circle vaughn  has already confirmed that another  kingsman film is in the works king's men  the blue blood which will be released in  the future picking up where the golden  circle left off a script from the movie  is reportedly already written and as far  as the plot is concerned bond said that  audiences should quote expect the  unexpected and this time taryn edgerton  and colin firth will be back as eggsy  and harry edgerton has said he's glad  he'll get a chance to return to the role  and he's hoping that the new film will  fare better with the critics than the  golden circle edgerton told empire i  would like the third one to be better  received than the second one was i felt  we got a bit of an unfair kicking if i'm  totally honest what i would like to  happen is for us to do a third one and  for it to feel like a worthy third  installment to what has been a great  part of my life there is also reportedly  a kingsman spin-off film in development  under the title of statesman this film  would presumably be all about kingsmen's  american counterpart organization by  that name which was featured prominently  in the golden circle  [Music]  that'll make you want to slap your mama  right there boy if the upcoming kingsman  films still aren't enough for you you're  in luck there's also reportedly a  kingsman television series planned the  series will supposedly include eight  hour long episodes but as of right now  there's very little info out about the  series it's simply known as the untitled  kingsman project and there's no release  date yet production on the show has not  yet started and there's no word about  who the cast will be basically we're in  the dark for now although vaughn  reportedly has quote something like  seven more kingsman films up his sleeve  if you're feeling a bit impatient about  the upcoming projects you can always  check out the animated archer and  kingsman crossover titled tbt to that  time archer met kingsman you probably  shouldn't tell people you're a spy then  what's the point in being one fair  enough the short features eggsy  alongside sterling archer with edgerton  voicing eggsy archer happens to find the  secret kingsman lair and outsmarts eggsy  at his own game during a drinking  contest  beat that  with so many things in the works fans  will be getting plenty of new material  for years to come there's still much to  explore in the world of kingsman check  out one of our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about  upcoming movies and tv shows are coming  soon subscribe to our youtube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Music]  you

